name: The Long Road
theme: desert
objective: reach
doctrine: ambush
order: 5
mechanic: extraction
brief: A long march east. Get everyone still standing to the pickup.
advice: A long march east. Get everybody still standing to the pickup. Emphasis, if I may, on still standing.
tile: 16
